{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15738","headline":"同张参军喜李尚书寄新琴 · 司空曙","name":"同张参军喜李尚书寄新琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新琴传凤凰，晴景称高张。\n白玉连徽净，朱丝系爪长。\n轻埃随拂拭，杂籁满铿锵。\n暗想山泉合，如亲兰蕙芳。\n正声消郑衞，古状掩笙簧。\n远识贤人意，清风愿激扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}